<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT ENGLAND BY TWO WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT ENGLAND BY TWO WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat England by two wickets in the first one-day international at Queen's Club on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 152 all out (45.5 overs), Zimbabwe 153-8 (43.5).</p>
